WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.361
In this video, you will add your city or group logo to your contest.

00:00:04.361 --> 00:00:05.343
We start on the map.

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:08.055
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:10.812 --> 00:00:13.362
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:15.304 --> 00:00:16.284
Then tap Allow.

00:00:19.803 --> 00:00:23.011
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:25.793
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:25.793 --> 00:00:30.356
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:30.356 --> 00:00:31.057
Tap it.

00:00:32.607 --> 00:00:34.566
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.224
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:40.224 --> 00:00:41.081
Tap Mine.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.849
This is your personal page.

00:00:44.849 --> 00:00:50.321
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:00:50.321 --> 00:00:52.429
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:54.177 --> 00:00:58.273
This opens your dashboard, the control room for your contest.

00:00:58.273 --> 00:01:00.235
In your dashboard, tap Details.

00:01:02.011 --> 00:01:03.816
Find Contest logo.

00:01:03.816 --> 00:01:07.788
Until you add one, we draw an icon from your contest name.

00:01:07.788 --> 00:01:12.014
A logo also stands in for homes that have no photo yet.

00:01:12.014 --> 00:01:15.999
Tap Upload a logo, and choose a picture from your phone or computer.

00:01:15.999 --> 00:01:19.020
A square picture works best.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.124
JPG, PNG, or WebP.

00:01:21.124 --> 00:01:23.460
Big images are shrunk for you.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.831
Your logo is saved right away.

00:01:25.831 --> 00:01:30.428
It shows on your contest page, and on every home that has no photo.

00:01:30.428 --> 00:01:33.128
To change it later, tap Replace logo.

00:01:33.128 --> 00:01:36.855
To go back to the drawn icon, tap Remove logo.

00:01:36.855 --> 00:01:38.591
That is how you add your logo.

00:01:38.591 --> 00:01:40.648
Your contest now looks like yours.

00:01:42.005 --> 00:01:43.776
Next up: Share your contest.
